From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:34:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Shader compiles on all cores when they pile up, faster
 shader-pack translation, store dump

- PERF-160: when 16 or more pipeline builds wait, the build workers may use every core (at
  below-normal priority, so the game's threads keep theirs) instead of only the efficiency cores
  of Intel hybrid CPUs; back to the efficiency cores at 2 or fewer. -DisablePerf 160 turns it off.
- PERF-161: RyGT's shader pack is translated on several threads (12,590 shaders: 36 s -> 14 s).
- PB-4 (SHADGT_DUMP_STORE=<folder>): writes the shader store's records and pipeline keys as text,
  each record translated again with every resource's sharp, for research.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
